WEBVTT

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:33.559
It is actually multifaceted
and intrinsic to relationship.

00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:36.851
And the question
that you wanted to ask is,

00:06:36.875 --> 00:06:40.559
is this power helping the system thrive,

00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:42.726
do what it needs to do, the relationship,

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.351
whatever the relationship is,

00:06:44.375 --> 00:06:49.101
or is this power
that becomes oppressive, abused?

00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:52.768
Which means a breach of trust.

00:06:52.792 --> 00:06:54.393
AG: So there's something weird --

00:06:54.417 --> 00:06:57.351
EP: Do you agree with the notion
that trust is intrinsic?

00:06:57.375 --> 00:07:00.768
Trust itself, it's like,
it's intrinsic to relationships.